WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:05.154
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:05.155 --> 00:00:08.551
What do they see?

3
00:00:08.552 --> 00:00:12.843
They see an art museum.

4
00:00:12.844 --> 00:00:36.026
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:36.027 --> 00:00:50.226
They are smiling.

6
00:00:50.227 --> 00:01:03.061
They are frowning.

7
00:01:03.062 --> 00:01:16.543
They are crying.

8
00:01:16.544 --> 00:01:27.175
They are dancing.

9
00:01:27.176 --> 00:01:34.801
They are screaming.

10
00:01:34.802 --> 00:01:51.947
They are laughing.

11
00:01:51.948 --> 00:02:00.205
Blobs, what are you doing now?

12
00:02:00.206 --> 00:02:03.118
That's not a painting.

13
00:02:03.119 --> 00:02:12.775
That's an exit sign.

14
00:02:12.776 --> 00:02:29.766
Silly blobs.

15
00:02:29.767 --> 00:02:32.938
Good-bye!

